        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_微笑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Noema, long time no see…",
        "zh": "梦之，好久不见……",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_微笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Long time no see! Seeing that you’re alright is such a relief.",
        "zh": "好久不见！看到你没事，我总算放心了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_微笑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Oh? You saw the news too?",
        "zh": "诶？你也看到新闻了？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Yeah. I just heard that the flight to Yuntai went missing, and I immediately thought of you... Good thing you made it here safely.",
        "zh": "嗯。刚刚听说那架飞来芸台的航班失联了，我一下就想到你……还好你平安到了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Noema, actually, I—",
        "zh": "梦之，其实我——",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_微笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "We’ve only just met again after so long. There’s no need to talk about that right away.",
        "zh": "好不容易见面，先不急着说这些。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_微笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "You only just got here yesterday, you must be exhausted. Did you get a good rest last night?",
        "zh": "你昨天刚到，一定很累吧？昨晚休息得还好吗？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "I’m alright. It’s just that what happened yesterday was really strange. I was going to tell you—",
        "zh": "我还好。只是昨天发生的事，实在有点奇怪，我本来想跟你说——",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Haha, let’s not talk about that while standing at the entrance.",
        "zh": "哈哈，别站在入口聊这些了。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "name": {
        "en": "Noema",
        "zh": "沈梦之",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/沈梦之_微笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Let me take you around the festival first. There are plenty of interesting stalls at the Qiqiao Festival.",
        "zh": "我先带你去会场里转转吧，乞巧大会上有很多有趣的摊位呢。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "textAlignment": 0,
      "nextIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_微笑",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Okay. Oh, by the way, I…",
        "zh": "好。对了，我......",
        "ja": ""
      },
